MID_EV30_028_m01_080: I will never forget... We will never forgive you.
MID_EV30_028_m01_081: There may have been some merit to his grievance.
MID_EV30_028_m01_082: But that doesn't give him the right to devour all\nin this world.
MID_EV30_028_m01_083: Nor is it cause enough to let Balor overrun it.
MID_EV30_028_m01_084: This all started with us, her children. And therefore...
MID_EV30_028_m01_085: <NCA>"It's not your fault."
MID_EV30_028_m01_086: Whether or not that's so, I must fulfill my role.
